      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A controlled low-temperature phase-selective recrystallization anneal can selectively recrystallize the soft FCC phase while preserving the hard B2 network.",
